part.text:
Zod 3.25 has the standard schema interface (`~standard` with `version`, `vendor`, `validate`). So passing Zod schemas directly to `validators.onChange` will work natively in TanStack Form v1.

Now, let me decide on the approach. I'll use the `zodValidator` from `@tanstack/zod-form-adapter` to create a validator, but actually the cleanest way to genuinely use the adapter while working with v1 is... 

